            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "And as your advocate, I'm obligated to assist you in the Rites. So if things get too hot for you, use this Treasure Card, and I'll come take some of the heat off. Good luck!",
